  "comments": "<p>Made-to-order coins exist:<br>Coins dated 2542 were struck on a copper planchet; PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/35515204\">#35515204</a> (6.6g), PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/37982043\">#37982043</a>.<br>// MTO set 2542 is consist of coins from 1 Satang to 5 Baht, with each type struck on copper, silver, and gold. 16~18 sets are believed to be made. (source by siamcoin)<br>- Aluminium-bronze, medal alignment (2544)<br>- Copper, medal alignment (2544)<br>- Silver, medal alignment (2544)<br>// MTO set 2544, struck as medal alignment.<br>- Coins dated 2542 struck on (10 Baht like) bi-metallic planchet. PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/36026876\">#36026876</a>. Non-graded coins also exist.<br>- Coin dated 2544 struck on (10 Baht like) bi-metallic 6.9g planchet. PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/35515205\">#35515205</a>.<br>- Coins dated 2545 struck on (10 Baht like) bi-metallic planchet.<br>- Coins struck as the double obverse. PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80704779\">#80704779</a>. (could be an error)<br>- Coins dated 2532 struck as a double reverse. PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80758343\">#80758343</a>. (could be an error)<br>- Coins dated 2547 struck as a double reverse. PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80704780\">#80704780</a>. (could be an error)<br>- Coins dated 2543 struck without a clad layer on the obverse. PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/35676310\">#35676310</a>. (could be an error)<br>- Coins dated 2543 struck without a clad layer on the reverse. PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/35676311\">#35676311</a>. (could be an error)<br>- Coins dated 2532 struck as medal alignment. PCGS <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80717156\">#80717156</a>. (could be an error)<br>&nbsp;</p><p>2540 ๒๕๔๐ minor varieties exist:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/686baafe9aa90.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/686baafe9aa90.jpg\"></a></p><p>The closed roofs variety is more difficult to find.</p><p><br>2546 ๒๕๔๖ exists in 2 versions:<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f03397415c87.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f03397415c87.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
